    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Reincarnator - Your destiny through infinite lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a mystical world where each life brings new power, purpose, and adventure. Starting as a beggar in Eldoria, the last city of humanity, master professions, train skills, and explore areas. Reincarnate, grow stronger, and uncover the secrets of your past in this endlessly rewarding journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jobs - Begin as a humble beggar and ascend through 47 unique jobs, each with its own challenges and hidden rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train - Train your skills across many trainings. Battle foes, overcome trials, and evolve into a true master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorations - Venture through 12 zones, each with their own stories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story - Discover 175 story fragments, face mythical creatures, and uncover lost treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnation - When one life ends, another begins. Rebirth with permanent boosts, progress faster, and push further than ever before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technologies - Unlock 80 technologies to improve Eldoria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regression, Magic, and Lifestlye - Unlocked 30 temporal skills to aid you, 20 spells, and 46 lifestyle choices to customize your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime - 30-40+ hours of content with an ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Reincarnator - Your destiny through infinite lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a mystical world where each life brings new power, purpose, and adventure. Starting as a beggar in Eldoria, the last city of humanity, master professions, train skills, and explore areas. Reincarnate, grow stronger, and uncover the secrets of your past in this endlessly rewarding journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jobs - Begin as a humble beggar and ascend through 47 unique jobs, each with its own challenges and hidden rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train - Train your skills across many trainings. Battle foes, overcome trials, and evolve into a true master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorations - Venture through 12 zones, each with their own stories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story - Discover 175 story fragments, face mythical creatures, and uncover lost treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reincarnation - When one life ends, another begins. Rebirth with permanent boosts, progress faster, and push further than ever before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technologies - Unlock 80 technologies to improve Eldoria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regression, Magic, and Lifestlye - Unlocked 30 temporal skills to aid you, 20 spells, and 46 lifestyle choices to customize your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime - 30-40+ hours of content with an ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
